### expired_token (stub answers: expired)
$ env GRAIN_TOKEN=BEFD-5JHV-6FP4-34MX-SQ3Z-QJAF-LJMF-7LP4 timeout 60 /home/debian/bin/grain --server http://127.0.0.1:4291 git-login -web -host 127.0.0.1:4294 -base-url http://127.0.0.1:4294 -scope acme/widgets
    ! First copy your one-time code: WDJB-MJHT
    - Open http://127.0.0.1:4294/login/device in your browser to authorize Grain...
      (Could not open browser automatically: exec: "xdg-open,x-www-browser,www-browser": executable file not found in $PATH)
    grain: the GitHub device code expired before authorization completed; run `grain git-login` again
    -> exit=1
    poll: {"answer":"expired","gap_s":null,"grant_type_ok":true}
